From: Armada <armada@armada.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: qcom-pm8150l-lcdb: add pm6150l-lcdb compatible

The PM6150L PMIC has the same LCDB display bias regulator peripheral
as PM8150L. Add qcom,pm6150l-lcdb to of_device_id match table.

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/qcom-pm8150l-lcdb-regulator.c b/drivers/regulator/qcom-pm8150l-lcdb-regulator.c
--- a/drivers/regulator/qcom-pm8150l-lcdb-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/qcom-pm8150l-lcdb-regulator.c
@@ -196,6 +196,7 @@ static int qcom_pm8150l_lcdb_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct of_device_id lcdb_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,pm8150l-lcdb" },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,pm6150l-lcdb" },
 	{ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, lcdb_match);
